<section image-layout="blank" id="ihpoJXSle5"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="esy5xYVPDC" background-color="accent" padding="28pt 12pt 24pt" colspan="7"><p role="eyebrow">Field guide</p><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><p role="caption">ASSURANCE</p><p role="caption">09 / 10</p></grid-item><grid-item id="h1nGvuhhWG" padding="22pt 30pt 20pt 28pt" colspan="53"><labels><label variant="outline">Illustrative replacement · validate before use</label></labels><h2 font-size="28pt">Launch confidence is a chain, not a checklist</h2><p font-size="16pt">One reporting dependency links warning, issue, response, and launch decision.</p><grid marker="number" marker-rule="true" marker-position="above" marker-align="start" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug" style="--marker-gap: 0.4em;"><grid-item id="_B2GXIn0iN" colspan="12"><h4>Reporting dependency</h4><p font-size="15pt">Async export → operating metrics.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="OdKa-VNrCM" colspan="12"><h4>R-02 · Warning</h4><p font-size="15pt">Refresh &gt;2h = high launch risk.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="ACBUEI_5UK" colspan="12"><h4>I-01 · Active issue</h4><p font-size="15pt">Representative export = 4.5h.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="7VuL45t8wy" colspan="12"><h4>A-06 · Response</h4><p font-size="15pt">Benchmark volume; prep daily fallback by T+5.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="puTiRB8yUJ" colspan="12"><h4>D-04 · Gate</h4><p font-size="15pt">Product Owner decides launch/delay at T+6.</p></grid-item></grid><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="gON8WmQZbm" colspan="38"><h3>Residual risk register</h3><table col-widths="[22,38]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false" style="--table-cell-padding: 5pt 7pt;"><tbody><tr><td><p>Risk</p></td><td><p>Trigger and response</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="15pt"><b>R-01 · Adoption</b><br><span font-size="14pt">Medium / high</span></p></td><td><p font-size="15pt">&gt;20% manual rerouting: Operations Lead gives category coaching + targeted rule review.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="15pt"><b>R-03 · Taxonomy drift</b><br><span font-size="14pt">Medium / medium</span></p></td><td><p font-size="15pt">&gt;10% uncategorized work: weekly Product Owner review; local categories prohibited.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="15pt"><b>R-04 · API limiting</b><br><span font-size="14pt">Low / high</span></p></td><td><p font-size="15pt">&gt;5 min queue age: Technical Lead enables throttling + controlled replay.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></grid-item><grid-item id="TWmVYa5Eq8" colspan="22"><h3>Open questions</h3><grid divider="sm neutral-border" marker="number" marker-position="inline" direction="vertical" vertical-sizing="hug" style="--marker-inline-size: 24pt; --marker-gap: 9pt;"><grid-item id="5YeneubMSv" padding="4pt 0"><p font-size="15pt">Can the export meet target at representative volume by T+5?</p></grid-item><grid-item id="ODhHsoS_4D" padding="4pt 0"><p font-size="15pt">Is a daily fallback acceptable for the first rollout group?</p></grid-item><grid-item id="TWRsm6-Brn" padding="4pt 0"><p font-size="15pt">What minimum pilot sample authorizes expansion?</p></grid-item><grid-item id="RDGRFpSho4" padding="4pt 0"><p font-size="15pt">Who approves an emergency override when no supervisor is available?</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>